	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## 🎾 ATP Tour — Alfred 5 Workflow

### Triggers (`atp`)
| Type this | What you get |
|-----------|-------------|
| `atp` | Current ATP Tour match scores (Live → Today Upcoming/Final → Recent Main Draw, Singles default) |
| `atp {filter}` | Filter scoreboard: `atp alcaraz`, `atp paris`, `atp live`, `atp doubles`, `atp qual`, `atp all` |
| `atpr` | Official PIF ATP Singles Rankings (Top 50 default) |
| `atpr {query}` | Filter rankings: `atpr top10`, `atpr all` (Top 150), `atpr usa`, `atpr ita`, `atpr sinner` |
| `atps` | Full-Season ATP Tour &amp; Grand Slam Calendar (Active → Upcoming → Completed) |
| `atps {query}` | Filter calendar: `atps slam`, `atps 1000`, `atps 500`, `atps clay`, `atps grass`, `atps {city/month}` |
| `atpt` / `atpt {query}` | Full Round-by-Round Tournament Draw (`Final` → `SF` → `QF` → `R16` → `R32`), `atpt doubles` |
| `atpp {player}` | Unified Player Profile (Rank, YTD &amp; Career W-L/Titles/Prize, `⌘` Serve Stats, `⌥` Return Stats) + Recent Matches |
</string>
